  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/EmboladaJuevesAlcudiaDeVeo.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>57 fotos de este jueves en la primera jornada taurina de las fiestas patronales de Alcudia de Veo, con vaquillas y toros de la ganader&iacute;a de Faet, uno de las cuales se ha embolado. El &uacute;ltimo d&iacute;a de toros es este s&aacute;bado, siempre con reses del mismo hierro. Las fiestas finalizan el domingo.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/alcudiadeveo17vespradavaquesdijous/img_0928.jpg\" alt=\"img_0928\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/alcudiadeveo17vespradavaquesdijous/img_0930.jpg\" alt=\"img_0930\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/alcudiadeveo17vespradavaquesdijous/img_0934.jpg\" alt=\"img_0934\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/alcudiadeveo17vespradavaquesdijous/img_0935.jpg\" alt=\"img_0935\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/alcudiadeveo17vespradavaquesdijous/img_0938.jpg\" alt=\"img_0938\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/alcudiadeveo17vespradavaquesdijous/img_0939.jpg\" alt=\"img_0939\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/alcudiadeveo17vespradavaquesdijous/img_0940.jpg\" alt=\"img_0940\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/alcudiadeveo17vespradavaquesdijous/img_0941.jpg\" alt=\"img_0941\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d47154